---
layout: base.njk
title: "Locations"
permalink: /locations/
---
<h1>Locations</h1>

<p>Recurring places in community maps. Each page collects every archived map that depicts the location.</p>

<ul class="locations-index">
	{% for loc in collections.locations %}
	{% set count = collections.entries | entriesForLocation(loc.fileSlug) | length %}
	<li>
		<a href="{{ loc.url }}">{{ loc.data.title }}</a>
		<span class="count">{% if count == 1 %}1 map{% else %}{{ count }} maps{% endif %}</span>
	</li>
	{% endfor %}
</ul>
